[h2]相關模組[/h2]

[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3622407938]無維護費[/url]
[/list]

[h2]獨特招募[/h2]

伊德林斯可以被那些可能重視他雙重本性的人招募為領主或英雄：
[list]
[*]帝國（尋求奧術知識）
[*]基斯列夫（急需強大盟友）
[*]高等精靈（希望收回自己人）
[*]木精靈（重視他與庫爾諾斯的聯繫）
[*]吸血鬼伯爵（接受他新獲得的力量）
[/list]
[h3]寬鬆背景模式[/h3]
在寬鬆背景模式中，添加了一些不太可能的派系，代表絕望的聯盟：
[list]
[*]布列托尼亞
[*]震旦
[*]黑暗精靈
[*]Legions of Nagash(modded Faction)
[*]吸血鬼海岸
[/list]

[h2]主要特性[/h2]

[h3]神聖恩惠系統[/h3]
在三位強大的精靈神祇之間平衡你的忠誠，每位都提供獨特的路徑來統一伊德林斯支離破碎的存在：
[list]
[*][b]凱恩[/b]：以增強的近戰能力和傷害輸出擁抱侵略
[*][b]阿蘇里安[/b]：通過改進的防禦和魔法抗性尋求平衡
[*][b]庫爾諾斯[/b]：以遠程優勢和機動性走獵人之路
[/list]

[b]教堂系統[/b]
Based on the divine influences, Idrinth can found chapels that noticeably affect garrison size, power and god favour use as well as benefiting the local economy and growth.

如果未使用所需模組，外國槽位可能會表現異常 - 除非你玩的派系已經有外國槽位，否則技術上不需要該模組。

[h3]敘事困境[/h3]
Face critical choices that shape Idrinth's character and determine his relationship with the divine. Will you embrace your elven roots or surrender to vampiric power? Each decision affects your divine favor and unlocks permanent bonuses.

[h3]神聖神器套裝[/h3]
收集並裝備增強伊德林斯能力的強大神明相關神器。完成一套以獲得補充你所選神聖道路的特殊加成。 Complete a set to earn special bonuses that complement your chosen divine path.

[h3]精靈殺手後果[/h3]
A dynamic trait system that tracks your battles against elven factions. The more elves you slay, the more you'll be known, despised, and eventually hated among their kind, with significant diplomatic and divine favor consequences.

[h3]奧術多才[/h3]
掌握多個魔法學派的法術，反映伊德林斯的學者背景和吸血鬼轉化：
[list]
[*]吸血鬼學派
[*]死亡學派
[*]陰影學派
[/list]

[h3]自定義戰鬥派系[/h3]

在單人和多人自定義戰鬥中以教堂勢力作為獨立派系進行遊戲。

[h3]動物WAAAGH[/h3]

The general collects a menagerie of allied animals around him, creating a waaagh out of blessed animals.

[h2]ALPHA版本通知[/h2]

This mod is in [b]EARLY ALPHA[/b] development. You may encounter:

[list]
[*]軍隊中某些按鈕可能無法使用
[*]某些UI更改需要一秒鐘才能應用
[*]平衡調整正在進行中
[*]祈禱系統暫時被隨機觸發的神聖干預取代
[/list]

Your feedback is essential for improvement! Please report any issues you encounter.

[h2]兼容性說明：[/h2]

The custom faction of Nagash is theoretically supported. The support needs play-testing though, if you find bugs report them here and don't bother the other mod!

[h2]模組中的AI[/h2]

模組中目前有一些AI生成的圖像。一旦單位身份和外觀最終確定，它們將隨著時間被適當的美術作品取代。 They are being replaced by proper art over time once the unit identity and looks are final.

[h2]社交媒體[/h2]
如果你想討論模組或需要支持，歡迎加入[url=https://discord.gg/idrinth]Discord[/url]！如果你想幫助修復問題，代碼在[url=https://github.com/Idrinth/tw-idrinth]GitHub[/url]！如果你想改進翻譯，請訪問[url=https://crowdin.com/project/idrinth-thalui/invite?h=e154f2cc138e3ad109516051cdd96edf2662006]Crowdin[/url] - 無需技術知識！ If you want to help fix things, the code is on [url=https://github.com/Idrinth/tw-idrinth]GitHub[/url]! If you want to improve translations visit [url=https://crowdin.com/project/idrinth-thalui/invite?h=e154f2cc138e3ad109516051cdd96edf2662006]Crowdin[/url] - no technical knowledge required!
